@startuml System_Control_Logic

title System Control Logic

top to bottom direction

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.2

skinparam packageBorderColor Black
skinparam packageBackgroundColor White
skinparam nodesep 25
skinparam ranksep 35

skinparam component {
    BackgroundColor White
    BorderColor Black
    FontColor Black
    FontSize 10
}

skinparam database {
    BackgroundColor White
    BorderColor Black
    FontColor Black
    FontSize 10
}

package "Presentation Layer" {

    component "React Web Application\n(User Interface)" as React

}

package "Application Layer" {

    component "FastAPI Backend\n(Business Logic & API Services)" as Backend

}

package "Processing Layer" {

    component "Computer Vision\n(OpenCV + MediaPipe)" as CV
    component "Avatar Generation" as Avatar
    component "Recommendation" as Recommend
    component "Visualization\n(Three.js)" as Visualize
    component "Garment Processing" as Garment

}

package "Data Layer" {

    database "PostgreSQL Database" as DB

}

React --> Backend : Requests

Backend --> CV : Process video

CV --> Avatar : Measurements

Avatar --> Recommend : Avatar data

Recommend --> Backend : Recommended size

Backend --> Visualize : Render fitting

Visualize --> React : Display results

Backend -[#000000,dashed]-> Garment : Validate garment
Garment -[#000000,dashed]-> Backend : Valid garment

Backend --> DB : Store / retrieve data

note right of Backend
Central control:
Authentication
Request validation
Business logic
Module coordination
Database access
end note

@enduml